					"nextDialogs": [
						700110105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ella Musk"
				},
				{
					"id": 700110105,
					"content": "Mani...? Zido mi, mi dada. Nye kundala? Mi plata yeye!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700110106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Hilichurl"
				},
				{
					"id": 700110106,
					"content": "โว้ว... เจ้าตัวนี้อารมณ์ร้ายชะมัด!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700110107,
						700110108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 700110107,
					"content": "คุณ Musk ระวังนะ...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700110109
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700110109,
					"content": "อย่าเพิ่งวู่วาม ไม่เป็นไรหรอก ฉันเข้าใจแล้วล่ะ",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700110110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ella Musk"
				},
				{
